      "seed": 942363789,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 87875173,
      "text": "Go x/net/http2 fix (CVE-2023-39325): run <= MaxConcurrentStreams handlers (default 250), queue the rest,\nskip streams reset in the queue, GOAWAY ENHANCE_YOUR_CALM if queue > 4x limit.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Go x/net/http2 fix (CVE-2023-39325): run <= MaxConcurrentStreams handlers (default 250), queue the rest,\nskip streams reset in the queue, GOAWAY ENHANCE_YOUR_CALM if queue > 4x limit.",
